   The register tables in src/registers.rs are transcribed from the Apache-2.0
   esp-video files listed in entry 1, derived in this repository, or - in the
   case of OV5647_MODE_800X1280_RAW8_50FPS - transcribed with the corrections
   entry 1 describes. The source legend of that file lists S1-S5 (esp-video),
   S8 and S9 (documents of OmniVision Technologies that are cited, not
   reproduced), and S10, S12 and S14 (also esp-video).

   The 2592x1944 RAW10 mode is derived here from the OV5647 datasheet (entry 5,
   tag S8 in src/registers.rs) and the esp-video reference (entry 1: S2 for the
   analog/ISP/AEC register block and the MIPI values, S10/S12/S14 for the stream
   and sentinel conventions), group by group, as the module documentation of
   src/registers.rs records. Register values are technical facts of the sensor
   and can coincide with values in any other OV5647 driver; this record documents
   the source each value was derived from and the attribution that goes with it,
   not that no other driver uses the same values.

   The esp-video tables of entry 1 are redistributed from esp-video under the
   licence those files declare: Apache-2.0, Espressif's declaration for the files
   it distributes, and the distribution source this repository took them from.
   That declaration and that source are what this notice relies on, and nothing
   here is legal advice.

   How the derived table was checked is documented with it: the `# Measurement`
   section of src/registers.rs records the end-to-end capture of a 6 298 560-byte
   2592x1944 RAW10 frame on this board, along with the blanking experiment behind
   the HTS value. Hardware results belong to that section; this notice records
   provenance and attribution only.
